
"smart_sources:2026-06-11 - Trump is taking aim at forest and wildfire research just as the West is poised to burn.md": {"path":"2026-06-11 - Trump is taking aim at forest and wildfire research just as the West is poised to burn.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1xrhroj","at":1785795033169},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1783540133412,"size":10441,"at":1785795033223,"hash":"1xrhroj"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"#":[10,37],"###Fire scientists worry critical research is being gutted":[38,49],"###Fire scientists worry critical research is being gutted#{1}":[40,49],"###Forest Service chief is defending the reorganization":[50,69],"###Forest Service chief is defending the reorganization#{1}":[52,69],"###Some state officials in the West say the Trump administration's plans are secretive":[70,90],"###Some state officials in the West say the Trump administration's plans are secretive#{1}":[72,90]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Kirk Siegler","target":"Kirk Siegler","line":5},{"title":"Wildfire and smoke maps like this one on the federal government's fire.airnow.gov website were developed, in part, from research funded by the U.S. Forest Service.","target":"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/1753cff/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1908x844+0+0/resize/1760x778!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr.brightspotcdn.com%2Fdims3%2Fdefault%2Fstrip%2Ffalse%2Fcrop%2F1908x844%200%200%2Fresize%2F1908x844%21%2F%3Furl%3Dhttp%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fc5%2Fa3%2F5de61d974069b6d1b46256bdf2d6%2Fscreenshot-2026-06-10-130358.png","line":10,"embedded":true},{"title":"Fire ecologist Ernesto Alvarado in his Seattle office at the University of Washington, which is a top recipient of federal research grants. ","target":"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/b9fbd24/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5712x4284+0+0/resize/1760x1320!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr.brightspotcdn.com%2Fdims3%2Fdefault%2Fstrip%2Ffalse%2Fcrop%2F5712x4284%200%200%2Fresize%2F5712x4284%21%2F%3Furl%3Dhttp%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F6c%2F5e%2F1289e2bc45e58d54f919c2758d5b%2Falvarado.jpg","line":24,"embedded":true},{"title":"a list of 56 out of 90 research stations","target":"https://www.fs.usda.gov/about-agency/reorganization","line":40},{"title":"U.S. Forest Chief Tom Schultz at U.S. Forest Service headquarters in Washington, D.C.","target":"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/bdbd7c8/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5000x3335+0+0/resize/1760x1174!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr.brightspotcdn.com%2Fdims3%2Fdefault%2Fstrip%2Ffalse%2Fcrop%2F5000x3335%200%200%2Fresize%2F5000x3335%21%2F%3Furl%3Dhttp%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F45%2Fc716462f490e850bdaecd6a0a477%2F260512-us-forest-chief-tom-schultz-08.jpg","line":56,"embedded":true},{"title":"Washington's public lands commissioner, Dave Upthegrove, says the state relies directly on U.S. Forest Service fire and smoke research to coordinate its wildfire suppression response. ","target":"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/5180b41/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5712x4284+0+0/resize/1760x1320!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr.brightspotcdn.com%2Fdims3%2Fdefault%2Fstrip%2Ffalse%2Fcrop%2F5712x4284%200%200%2Fresize%2F5712x4284%21%2F%3Furl%3Dhttp%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F6a%2F8d%2F0f6618e746a1b5af6dda2823c5ea%2Fupthegrove.jpg","line":78,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"Trump is taking aim at forest and wildfire research just as the West is poised to burn","source":"https://www.boisestatepublicradio.org/science-research/2026-06-11/trump-is-taking-aim-at-forest-and-wildfire-research-just-as-the-west-is-poised-to-burn?utm_source=newsletters.idahocapitalsun.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=state-revenue-down-from-projection-parma-r-e-celebrates-100-water-supply-simply-is-not-there&_bhlid=b766785c4add30292093cad7e58f2848cf0c9b5f","author":["[[Kirk Siegler]]"],"published":"2026-06-11","created":"2026-07-08","description":"The president is trying to downsize the U.S Forest Service and eliminate wildfire and smoke research as the American West is facing a potentially epic summer fire season."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},